id=poco_hyperos_launcher
name=HyperOS Launcher for POCO
version=v1.2
versionCode=120
author=haoyu-UT
description=Adds the HyperOS launcher (com.miui.home @LAUNCHER_VERSION@) as a system app and points Recents/gestures at it; optionally ships the China default theme. POCO Launcher is hidden meanwhile; disable or remove the module to get it back (with a fresh layout).
